From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:08:15 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] DXVA on 9_3: wait for the converted frame, not for the
 decoded one

The wait before the video processor did not stop old frames from showing and
held the decoder behind the page's GPU work. Wait after the conversion
instead, with an event query, and note every 300 frames how long it took.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
